s-module__vteZuW__dropdown \"><div class=\"UserMenu-module-scss-module__vteZuW__guestHeader\">Guest</div><div class=\"UserMenu-module-scss-module__vteZuW__menuLinks\"><a class=\"UserMenu-module-scss-module__vteZuW__menuItem\" href=\"/profile?tab=favorites\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/heart-outline.svg\"/><span>Favorites</span></a></div><div class=\"UserMenu-module-scss-module__vteZuW__divider\"></div><button class=\"UserMenu-module-scss-module__vteZuW__menuItem\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/profile-gray.svg\"/><span>Login / Sign up</span></button></div></div></div></div></nav><main><div class=\"AboutPage-module-scss-module__7WUJ-q__page\"><div class=\"PageHeader-module-scss-module__uADOvq__headerWrapper \"><div class=\"PageHeader-module-scss-module__uADOvq__decorationWrapper\"><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"340\" height=\"247\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"PageHeader-module-scss-module__uADOvq__decoration\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/dotted-line3.svg\"/></div><div class=\"PageHeader-module-scss-module__uADOvq__container\"><div class=\"PageHeader-module-scss-module__uADOvq__breadcrumbRow\"><nav class=\"Breadcrumb-module-scss-module__qhiPlq__breadcrumb PageHeader-module-scss-module__uADOvq__breadcrumbComp\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ul class=\"Breadcrumb-module-scss-module__qhiPlq__list\"><li class=\"Breadcrumb-module-scss-module__qhiPlq__item\"><a class=\"Breadcrumb-module-scss-module__qhiPlq__link\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Home\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"Breadcrumb-module-scss-module__qhiPlq__homeIcon\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/home.svg\"/><span>Home</span></a></li><li class=\"Breadcrumb-module-scss-module__qhiPlq__item\"><span class=\"Breadcrumb-module-scss-module__qhiPlq__separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span class=\"Breadcrumb-module-scss-module__qhiPlq__current\">About Us</span></li></ul></nav></div><h1 class=\"PageHeader-module-scss-module__uADOvq__title\" style=\"max-width:950px\">Where Corporate Vision Becomes Experience</h1><p class=\"PageHeader-module-scss-module__uADOvq__subtitle\" style=\"max-width:900px\">We transform strategic objectives into seamless travel and event solutions tailored for modern organizations.</p></div></div><section class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__section\"><div class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__container\"><div class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__tabsWrapper\"><div class=\"CategoryTabs-module-scss-module__LKepJq__wrapper AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__leftAlignTabs\"><div class=\"CategoryTabs-module-scss-module__LKepJq__tabs\"><button class=\"CategoryTabs-module-scss-module__LKepJq__tab CategoryTabs-module-scss-module__LKepJq__active\">Our Story</button><button class=\"CategoryTabs-module-scss-module__LKepJq__tab \">Vision</button><button class=\"CategoryTabs-module-scss-module__LKepJq__tab \">Mission</button></div></div></div><div class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__contentGrid\"><div class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__textContent\"><h2 class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__mainTitle\">About Us</h2><div class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__paragraphGroup\"><h3 class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__paragraphTitle\">Our Story</h3><div class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__paragraphLine\">In 2000, we started with a simple belief: Egypt&#x27;s incredible history, culture, and hospitality deserve to be experienced in extraordinary ways. What began as a small team passionate about sharing Egypt&#x27;s wonders has grown into a trusted partner for travelers and corporations worldwide.</div></div><div class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__paragraphGroup\"><h3 class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__paragraphTitle\">The Core</h3><div class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__paragraphLine\">Over the past 15 years, we&#x27;ve organized over 500 successful events, welcomed thousands of guests, and built lasting relationships with hotels, venues, and service providers across Egypt. Our team combines deep local knowledge with international expertise to deliver seamless, memorable experiences.</div></div></div><div class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__imageContent\"><img alt=\"Felucca on the Nile\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"AboutStory-module-scss-module__0MR-vq__image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-story.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-story.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-story.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-story.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-story.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-story.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-story.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-story.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-story.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-story.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__section\"><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__decoration\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"215\" height=\"215\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__decorationImg\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/dotted-line6.svg\"/></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__container\"><div class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__header SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__center\"><span class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__label\"><img alt=\"Trips\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__labelIcon\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/trips2.svg\"/>Why Trust US ?</span><h2 class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__heading  \">Built on Trust, Proven by Results</h2><p class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__description\">We&#x27;ve earned the confidence of leading organizations worldwide through consistent excellence, transparency, and dedication to our clients&#x27; success.</p></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featuresGrid\"><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__customFeatureCard\"><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__iconBox\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whytrustus/blue-earth.svg\"/></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featureTextContent\"><h3 class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featureTitle\">Local Expertise, Global Standards</h3><p class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featureDesc\">We combine deep Egyptian knowledge with international best practices to deliver world-class experiences</p></div></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__customFeatureCard\"><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__iconBox\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whytrustus/blue-check.svg\"/></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featureTextContent\"><h3 class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featureTitle\">Proven Track Record</h3><p class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featureDesc\">500+ successful events for Fortune 500 companies, government agencies, and leading organizations</p></div></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__customFeatureCard\"><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__iconBox\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whytrustus/blue-check.svg\"/></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featureTextContent\"><h3 class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featureTitle\">24/7 Dedicated Support</h3><p class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featureDesc\">Our team is available around the clock to ensure your event runs smoothly from start to finish</p></div></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__customFeatureCard\"><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__iconBox\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whytrustus/chart-arrow.svg\"/></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featureTextContent\"><h3 class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featureTitle\">Continuous Innovation</h3><p class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__featureDesc\">We stay ahead of industry trends to offer cutting-edge solutions and unforgettable experiences</p></div></div></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgesGrid\"><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeCard\" style=\"background:#F9FFFB\"><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeIcon\" style=\"color:#00C950\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whytrustus/green-check.svg\"/></div><h4 class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeTitle\">Licensed &amp; Certified</h4><span class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeDesc\">compliant with Egyptian tourism regulations</span></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeCard\" style=\"background:#FFFBF8\"><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeIcon\" style=\"color:#FF6600\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whytrustus/award.svg\"/></div><h4 class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeTitle\">Award-Winning</h4><span class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeDesc\">Recognized for excellence in service</span></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeCard\" style=\"background:#FAFCFF\"><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeIcon\" style=\"color:#2971E6\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whytrustus/shield-security.svg\"/></div><h4 class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeTitle\">Secure &amp; Insured</h4><span class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeDesc\">Comprehensive insurance coverage</span></div><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeCard\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(223, 255, 230, 0.2), rgba(223, 255, 230, 0.2)), #FFFFFF\"><div class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeIcon\" style=\"color:#00C950\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whytrustus/green-profile.svg\"/></div><h4 class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeTitle\">Expert Team</h4><span class=\"AboutFeatures-module-scss-module__2vNa2q__badgeDesc\">Multilingual professionals at your service</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__section\"><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__container\"><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__grid\"><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__imagesWrapper\"><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__imagesGrid\"><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__imageWrap AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__img1\"><img alt=\"Team meeting\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__imageWrap AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__img2\"><img alt=\"Team posing\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam2.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam2.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam2.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam2.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam2.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam2.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__imageWrap AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__img3\"><img alt=\"Team working\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam3.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam3.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam3.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam3.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam3.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam3.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam3.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam3.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam%2Fteam3.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__pagination\"><button class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__dotActive\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1\"></button><button class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__dot\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2\"></button><button class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__dot\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3\"></button></div></div><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__content\"><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__textGroup\"><span class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__label\">The Team</span><h2 class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__heading\">Meet the Team Behind the Experience</h2></div><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__paragraphs\"><p>Behind every successful corporate event, executive retreat, and large-scale company program is a team that believes in precision, structure, and accountability.</p><p>Our team brings together professionals with expertise in corporate travel planning, event management, logistics coordination, venue negotiation, hospitality partnerships, and on-site operations. Each member understands that in the corporate world, details are not optional — they define the outcome.</p></div></div><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statsRow\"><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statItem\"><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statIconWrap\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statIcon\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whytrustus/green-profile.svg\"/></div><span class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statValue\">100%</span><span class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statDesc\">Dedicated <br class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__mobileBr\"/> Corporate Focus</span></div><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statItem\"><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statIconWrap\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statIcon\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whytrustus/award.svg\"/></div><span class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statValue\">15,000+</span><span class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statDesc\">Attendees <br class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__mobileBr\"/> Managed</span></div><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statItem\"><div class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statIconWrap\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statIcon\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whytrustus/chart-arrow.svg\"/></div><span class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statValue\">8+ Years</span><span class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__statDesc\">Industry <br class=\"AboutTeam-module-scss-module__LD_GkG__mobileBr\"/> Experience</span></div></div></div></div></section><div><section class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__section\"><div class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__container\"><div class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__grid\"><div class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__infoCard\"><div class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__headerRow\"><div class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__whatsappIcon\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19.79\" height=\"19.79\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whatsapp.svg\"/></div><span class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__label\">Contact</span></div><h2 class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__heading\">Still not sure where to start? Contact us and fill out the form.</h2><p class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__description\">Contact us and fill out the form, let us know what you need.</p><div class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__social\"><div class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__avatars\"><div class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__avatar\" style=\"z-index:3\"><img alt=\"Traveler\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"ContactSection-module-scss-module__OWQGbW__avatarImg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"40px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontact1.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontact1.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimage